<p>You project tentacles in a cone of radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 7, 8</acronym> in front of you.</p><p>Any foes caught inside are grappled by the tentacles and suffer <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">106%, 117%, 126%, 133%, 140%</acronym> weapon damage as blight, if the attack hits the creatures are also pulled towards you.</p>